{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機 iPhone Duo 正式上市後，維修機構 iFixit 發佈了這款設備的拆解分析。結果顯示，iPhone Duo 的內部組件整體較容易拆卸，電池也採用了便於維修的固定方式，在摺疊屏手機中表現相對突出。不過，設備內部複雜的鉸鏈結構引發了擔憂，尤其是近期部分用户報告的鉸鏈卡頓及內屏損壞問題，使這款產品的長期耐用性受到關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583926.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.111038+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_hash":"9777a0c7852a6f1124e823c09b878d907d9a801a5a22220ff0cc0e337110c241","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}